<title>LEBANON: Beirut's BRB bank to issue $10 mln CDs.</title>
<headline>Beirut's BRB bank to issue $10 mln CDs.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beirut Riyad Bank will issue three-year certificates of deposit worth $10 million on the Beirut market next month, Fidus finance house said in a statement.</p>
<p>Underwriter Fidus said the dollar-denominated CD bearer notes would be launched on June 2 and would carry interest at 275 basis points over three-year U.S. Treasuries, payable every six months.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (9611) 645307  745308  602057</p>
